<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June palm oil exports 611,368t - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June palm oil exports 611,368t - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd on Monday said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for June at 611,368 tonnes against 672,805 tonnes for May.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 131,486 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 260,014 of RBD palm olein and 75,649 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products totalled 144,219 tonnes.</p>
</text>
